  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.2 - Async/sync path separation: new FillCompositionAsync (no more sync-over-async hangs on cyclic compositions), truly-async paginated builder, path-based cycle guard with depth cap, paged queries now honor loadComposition, sync APIs run on sync executors; PostgreSQL inserts with client-generated keys skip lastval (55000 fallback). v2.0.1 - Rochas.SqlWrapper 1.1.2 -> 1.4.8 (PostgreSQL-valid GROUP BY + EntityReflector with cache). v2.0.0 - [NEW] PostgreSQL support in CompositeCommand (parameterized Query/Search Paginate, Add, Update and Remove now run on Npgsql: null maps to DBNull, Guid maps to text following GuidStringHandler); test project now consumes Rochas.CacheIndexer 1.1.0 from NuGet instead of a local ProjectReference. v1.9.8 - Contracts moved to Rochas.Data.Specification (DataSpecification), replacing the internal Rochas.DapperRepository.Specification project.",
